{
  "_id": "9MDIAUzgWfJCMT0m",
  "name": "莹月短弓 Glimmering Moon Shortbow (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "36",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>武器（短弓），珍稀（需同调）</em> <br />这把银黑相间的弓上刻有月相。你使用这把弓进行的攻击检定和伤害掷骰获得+1加值。</p><p>当你用这把魔法弓进行的攻击检定命中时，目标受到额外[[/damage 1d6 type=radiant]]伤害。如果这把武器没有装填弹药，它会在你使用它进行一次远程攻击时自动为自己制造出一发魔法弹药。被创造出的弹药命中或落空后会消失。你持握这把魔法弓时，可以用一个附赠动作进入半虚体状态，该状态持续到你的下个回合开始。在半虚体状态，你获得对钝击、穿刺和挥砍伤害的抗性。 此附赠动作一经使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p>This silver-and-black bow is engraved with the phases of the moon. You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic weapon.</p><p>When you hit with a ranged attack roll using this magic bow, the target takes an extra [[/damage 1d6 type=radiant]] damage. If you load no ammunition in the weapon, it produces its own, automatically creating one piece of magic ammunition when you make a ranged attack with it. The ammunition created by the bow vanishes the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p><p>While wielding this magic bow, you can use a bonus action to enter a semi-incorporeal state until the start of your next turn. While semi-incorporeal, you have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage. Once this bonus action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
